# a project saved by 0.9 before the layer pages (format 3) loads with its settings; the bass's and
# the pulse's new ones come from each piece's recipe
wait 300
turn PRESET 4
expect piece 4
storev3 33
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 4
expect par0 33
expect par23 0
expect par24 10
expect par25 45
expect par26 30
expect par27 70
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 33
expect par26 30
# (each voice's first modulator from Night Bus's recipe: depth 35, a walk, Metal)
expect par32 35
expect par34 6
expect par35 3
expect par116 35
# a project of the first FM6 build (format 5: one MOD for all three voices) loads with it as each voice's first
# modulator; the patches as they were
storev5 55
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 4
expect par0 33
expect par32 55
expect par74 55
expect par116 55
expect par34 7
expect par35 4
expect par119 4
expect par28 6
expect par31 0
expect par33 31
# a project of 1.3.91 (format 6: each voice its own MOD and FM edits) loads with its MOD as the first modulator and
# the pad's edits baked into its patch (Night Bus's Rhodes: feedback 0 + 2; OP6, a modulator at x1, x2)
storev6 44
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 4
expect par32 44
expect par116 44
expect par34 4
expect par35 6
expect par30 1
expect par72 0
expect pat0_135 2
expect pat0_18 2
# a project of 1.3.93 (format 7) loads as it was, its patches too (the pad's edits above), each voice playing as AMB-1
# does now: on its patch's envelopes (ENV, par156: 1), its GATE at the default (70)
storev7
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 4
expect par32 44
expect par116 44
expect pat0_135 2
expect pat0_18 2
expect par156 1
expect par157 70
# a project of 1.3.95 (format 8) loads with its GATEs (40), each voice the role its layer had (Chord, Loops, Bass), on
# its patch's envelopes, the bells' Tubular (3 in format 8) as the eighteen number it (9)
storev8 40
reboot
wait 300
expect par157 40
expect par168 40
expect par179 40
expect par156 1
expect par158 0
expect par169 1
expect par180 2
expect par28 9
# format 13 (1.4.2): the targets one on, Off first; a modulator at depth 0 (it did nothing) Off. The fifth piece: the
# first voice's second modulator Feedback (par43), its third at depth 0 (par51), the reel's first Speed (par201), its
# second at depth 0 (par207)
expect piece 4
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 100
expect par43 4
expect par51 0
expect par201 1
expect par207 0
storev13
reboot
wait 300
expect par43 4
expect par51 0
expect par201 1
expect par207 0
